     "kind": "mesaya",
     "gloss_en": "איתמר נמי, אמר רבי יוסי ברבי חנינא: הואיל וראוי להקישו על גבי חרס",
     "supports": "p_rava_heksho",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_gamea",
     "gloss_en": "R' Yochanan: since it is fit to give a child water to drink from it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59a.3",
   "sugya": "shabbat_58b_nitlu_inbaleihen",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_tl_asher_yeshev",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "תלמוד לומר אשר ישב עליו הזב -- מי שמיוחד לישיבה",
     "supports": "p_meyuchad_lishiva",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ry_lo_baei_meein",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ורבי יוחנן לא בעי מעין מלאכה ראשונה? והתניא ... יצא זה שאומרים לו עמוד ונעשה מלאכתנו; ורבי יוחנן אמר: אף אומר בטמא מת עמוד ונעשה מלאכתנו -- giving a child water is not a bell's first use",
     "against": "p_ry_gamea",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_meyuchad_lishiva",
     "gloss_en": "the baraita: [midras impurity applies to] what is designated for sitting, excluding that of which one says [to the zav] 'stand, and we will do our work'"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59a.6",
   "sugya": "shabbat_58b_nitlu_inbaleihen",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_ha_shamainan_meein",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "הא שמעינן ליה לרבי יוחנן דבעי מעין מלאכה ראשונה",
     "supports": "p_ipuch_kamaita",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_dtanya_sandal",
     "kind": "tanya_kevatei",
     "gloss_en": "דתניא: סנדל של בהמה של מתכת טמא ... ורבי יוחנן אמר: מניחו ברגליו -- his use for a person is the sandal's own kind of use",
     "supports": "p_ry_baei_meein_rishona",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_ha_shamainan",
     "gloss_en": "הא שמעינן ליה לרבי יוחנן דבעי מעין מלאכה ראשונה (the sandal baraita) -- so the latter pair is right as stated",
     "answers": "obj_mai_chazit",
     "restores": "p_ipuch_kamaita"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ry_baei_meein_rishona",
     "gloss_en": "we have heard that R' Yochanan requires [a use] akin to the first use"
    }
   ]
  },
